I now sit at my small table.
It is lovely and warm here.
I look at my cinnamon roll.
It smells sweet and good.
I take a small bite.
The pastry is completely fresh and warm.
It tastes really good.
I drink a little of my black coffee.
Finally, my fingers are warm again.
I relax in the soft chair.
The café is almost full of people.
People sit in small groups.
They talk and laugh together.
I listen to the low voices in the room.
The sound is very cozy.
I look out of the large window.
The weather outside is gray and windy.
Now it is actually snowing again.
White snowflakes fall slowly down onto the street.
I am just happy to be inside.
